# THIRD_BANNER_SUBTITLE=Free Delivery and Installation
# THIRD_BANNER_RESOLUTION=2K (optional: 1K/2K/4K for the bedroom blend)
# Sale Banner (1800x600): dining room + pendant on the left, kitchen + 2 pendants on the right, sale panel in a colour Claude suggests per run (CLI --panel-color overrides).
