# -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Style This Story - ADD A NEW TABLE HERE (no code changes needed)
# -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Each new table = one numbered block (N = 1, 2, 3, ...). Only TABLE_ID
# is required. Once added, run it with:  --category <slug>
# where <slug> is the NAME lowercased with underscores (e.g. "Table Lamps"
# -> table_lamps), or set KEY to choose the slug yourself.
#
# Fields:
#   NAME            (label shown in menus; also becomes the --category slug)
#   TABLE_ID        (required) Airtable table id, e.g. tblXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
#   MOODBOARD_ID    Krea moodboard id for this table (defaults to floor-lamp board)
#   PROMPT          Krea room-interior prompt for this table
#   AKENEO_CATEGORY (optional) product source to scrape: floor_lamps, wall_lights,
#                   pendant_lights, chandeliers, table_lamps, ... (defaults floor_lamps)
#   KEY             (optional) explicit --category slug override
#
# Example (uncomment & edit):
# STYLE_THIS_CUSTOM_1_NAME=Table Lamps
# STYLE_THIS_CUSTOM_1_TABLE_ID=tblXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
# STYLE_THIS_CUSTOM_1_MOODBOARD_ID=xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx
# STYLE_THIS_CUSTOM_1_PROMPT=Generate me a modern living room with a table lamp
# STYLE_THIS_CUSTOM_1_AKENEO_CATEGORY=table_lamps
#
# STYLE_THIS_CUSTOM_2_NAME=Ceiling Lights
# STYLE_THIS_CUSTOM_2_TABLE_ID=tblYYYYYYYYYYYYYY
# STYLE_THIS_CUSTOM_2_MOODBOARD_ID=yyyyyyyy-yyyy-yyyy-yyyy-yyyyyyyyyyyy
# STYLE_THIS_CUSTOM_2_PROMPT=Generate me a modern bedroom with a ceiling light


# ===================================================================
# Before & After Reel - BUILT-IN TABLES (fully controlled from .env)
# -------------------------------------------------------------------
# EVERYTHING per table lives here in .env - NO code changes needed.
# (Verified: config.py reads these first; the hardcoded values in
#  config.py are only fallbacks used when a variable below is blank.)
#
# Each table (category) has 5 settings you can edit freely:
#   AIRTABLE_TABLE_ID_BEFORE_AFTER_<CATEGORY>  -> Airtable table id (WHERE rows go)
#   KREA_MOODBOARD_ID_BEFORE_AFTER_<CATEGORY>  -> Krea moodboard id (visual style)
#   BEFORE_AFTER_PROMPT_<CATEGORY>             -> Krea room-interior prompt (the "Before" room)
#   BEFORE_AFTER_AKENEO_CATEGORY_<CATEGORY>    -> which products to SCRAPE from Akeneo
#        (valid: floor_lamps, pendant_lights, chandeliers, wall_lights, table_lamps, ...)
#   BEFORE_AFTER_PLACEMENT_RULE_<CATEGORY>     -> (optional) Claude Sonnet vision placement rule
#
# TIP: To change where a reel scrapes/generates, just edit the value here
#      and re-run - the automation picks it up automatically.
# ===================================================================

