# -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Before & After Reel - ADD A NEW TABLE HERE (no code changes needed)
# -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Each new table = one numbered block (N = 1, 2, 3, ...). Only TABLE_ID
# is required. Once added, run it with: python run_before_after_reel.py --target <slug>
# or pick it from the interactive terminal menu: python "Before and After Reel/4_Interactive_Menu.py"
#
# Fields:
#   NAME            (label shown in menus; also becomes the --target slug)
#   TABLE_ID        (required) Airtable table id, e.g. tblXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
#   MOODBOARD_ID    Krea moodboard id for this table
#   PROMPT          Krea room-interior prompt for this table
#   AKENEO_CATEGORY (optional) product source to scrape: floor_lamps, wall_lights,
#                   pendant_lights, chandeliers, table_lamps, ... (defaults floor_lamps)
#   PLACEMENT_RULE  (optional) Claude Sonnet vision placement instructions
#   KEY             (optional) explicit --target slug override
#
# Example (uncomment & edit):
# BEFORE_AFTER_CUSTOM_1_NAME=Ceiling Mounted
# BEFORE_AFTER_CUSTOM_1_TABLE_ID=tblXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
# BEFORE_AFTER_CUSTOM_1_MOODBOARD_ID=xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx
# BEFORE_AFTER_CUSTOM_1_PROMPT=Generate me a modern minimalist dining room
# BEFORE_AFTER_CUSTOM_1_AKENEO_CATEGORY=chandeliers
# BEFORE_AFTER_CUSTOM_1_PLACEMENT_RULE=Mount gracefully on ceiling with soft ambient lighting



